  "question": {
    "text": "A silver atom in a solid oscillates in simple harmonic motion in some direction with a frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> . What is the force constant of the bonds connecting one atom with the other? (Mole wt. of silver,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and Avogadro number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
