  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given, molecular weight of silver&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;and Avogadro&#39;s number<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></math>,<br />frequency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>f</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.</p><p>Mass of single silver atom will be given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>108</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>79</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>79</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math></p></blockquote><blockquote><p>The bonds between the atoms can be considered as spring and then using the spring analog, the time period of the oscillation of the atoms is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>; where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is spring constant.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>79</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p></blockquote>",
